   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Flapping: for-duration + hysteresis\n\u2022 Dedup key = fingerprint of labels\n\u2022 Group related alerts into one incident\n\u2022 Page must arrive: retries + fallback channel\n\u2022 Escalate if no ack in N min\n\u2022 Evaluator HA without double paging",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Flapping: for-duration + hysteresis\n\u2022 Dedup key = fingerprint of labels\n\u2022 Group related alerts into one incident\n\u2022 Page must arrive: retries + fallback channel\n\u2022 Escalate if no ack in N min\n\u2022 Evaluator HA without double paging",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
